Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby, oh,\Nwe share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see, but to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought on by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.80,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.10,0:01:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.06,0:01:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go, one straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.70,0:01:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.70,0:01:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, show us that smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.42,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go, beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there,\Njust on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me, soon\Nit will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go, beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world if we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.10,0:02:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.86,0:02:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.18,0:02:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got muscle cramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I know that I have many\Nmuscles to cramp in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice work back there, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You really thinned those\Nfish riders out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy to be of service.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:02:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think I need a moment of respite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, it's just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your injuries from Thriller\NBark haven't healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Injured or not, there's no way\NI'm losing to a bunch of fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.84,0:03:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down, Roronoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.76,0:03:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Six-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tentacle sword! Overload!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that you paying me back for last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, not really, but you\Ntwo gotta watch your backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That was super cool, Hatchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I told him you were strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.94,0:03:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, fish man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops! Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.42,0:04:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs to watch us back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Revert to formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.66,0:04:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Convert!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.89,0:04:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly high formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Pervert fly guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.46,0:04:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.98,0:04:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not talking about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.94,0:04:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The head's said to kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.90,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.94,0:04:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad. Mirage tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and watch out for those\Nthunder clouds, by the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dos manos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:04:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Clutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Cloven!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Diamond!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Convert again! Quick!\NYeah? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this! You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I need to get my ears checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.88,0:05:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That pervert is bulletproof!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They're tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, super-duper tough!\NDid you see? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are tough, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.28,0:05:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought we'd just grab\NHachi and maybe get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,not fight to the last man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A little bit closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky, we gotta\Npull the ship ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got the upper hand in the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Out here, we're nothing but sitting ducks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you think they don't know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is their base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try to move the ship, they'll\Njust come at us twice as hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.41,0:06:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Big one coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron mask guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and he's on a huge cow! Cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.50,0:06:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like more to\Nfollow! It's the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at you, getting swatted\Ndown left and right. Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.50,0:06:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.66,0:06:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not mosquitoes, men.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're flying. Fish riders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.32,0:06:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just crush his own house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Straw Hats dead,\NI won't need this base!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.34,0:06:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.34,0:06:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hen, we're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll drag him off to the\Nsea and finish him for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about fishmen or\Nmermaids or giant talking gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you five seconds to\Nget the hell out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but I'm a starfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.29,0:06:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't get into the slave\Ntrade market because I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Hen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest day of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The man that I've dreamed of\Nkilling is right before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have suffered to get here,\Nbut it's all been worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.28,0:07:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta admit that miracles\Ncan happen after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I never did a damn thing to that\Nbastard and he made my life hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He ruined me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's his deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he talking to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to lose anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ending this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.62,0:07:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I die, I'm killing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Black-leg Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this for a\Nlong time. He's mad! His accent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.74,0:07:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell did I\Ndo? That's weird. Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck did you do to\Npiss this guy off so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe something back on the Baratie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, try to remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if we're going back that far...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I did all sorts of\Nstuff to piss people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.68,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I can't even count them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.80,0:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, better let them kill you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me, blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't that long ago, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are harpoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, if it was something\Nrecent, I'm even more confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is not good, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.00,0:08:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something up with these harpoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My scorpion harpoons\Nare packed with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,If they so much as nick you,\Nyou won't last three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill you and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, who in the hell is this bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.08,0:08:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You reef what you sow, Blackleg!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw what was under that\Nmask of his. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:08:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be surprised, but\Nyou've seen his face. I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! That bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked out Master Duvall's mask!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,See this cursed face of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I couldn't let you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.60,0:09:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I set out to see that an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I knew I had my work cut out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.84,0:10:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your wanted poster\Ndidn't look nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the Navy or some\Nbounty hunter saw you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,they'd never know they were\Nlooking at the guy on the poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But they found someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.02,0:10:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone they hounded day\Nin and day out. Oh, head.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And when they found him, do\Nyou know what they'd say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't hide from us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Black-Legged Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.80,0:10:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, do you know what I told him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even met the guy before
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And not only that, I ain't even a pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.54,0:10:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Black-Legged Sanji, you ruined\Nme. This is all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Sanji, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you imagine how\Nscared I was being hunted?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,like an animal the navy\Nheadquarters hounded me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,At every turn famous bounty hunters\Nknocking at my door I didn't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.46,0:11:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,hurt nobody I just Wanted a life of\Npeace and quiet and you destroyed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.06,0:11:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I ever do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back My life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Black leg! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.66,0:11:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't take responsibility\Nfor this Then who will huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more pissed off about the\Nstupid wanted poster than anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In a way I guess they both got it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:11:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a crazy world we live in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.66,0:12:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's a\Nlucky one or an unlucky one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But he must have been born\Nunder some kind of star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether this is a miracle or a\Ntragedy It's entertaining either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think we can\Nmake friends with Devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They really do look the same, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Two peas in a pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When are I done with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna flatten you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You go ahead and take care of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.22,0:12:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll sit this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like it's my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you didn't want to look\Nlike the stupid wanted poster,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,then why didn't you\Njust cut your damn hair
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.30,0:12:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,or grow a beard instead\Nof trying to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.99,0:12:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.32,0:12:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're that stupid, you\Ncan only blame yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.08,0:12:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We just wanted a simple\Nlife, nothing fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.72,0:13:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.04,0:13:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We were running a humble little\Ncriminal outfit in these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trying to make ends meet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't do anything wrong we just\Nextorted some money from people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a simple life, but a happy one
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're\Ndoing all the way out here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But we found you. Now surrender and save\Nus all some trouble. I ain't telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't even met the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.38,0:13:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand, Blackleg, it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I never wanted to cause any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.88,0:13:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And suddenly I get a bounty of 77 million\Nbecause you don't know how to behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A small-town guy like me can't stand\Nup to all those powerful marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They hunted me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.32,0:13:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I gotta hide behind that iron\Nmask so nobody will recognize my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.06,0:14:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My whole life is ruined because\Nyou decided to be a damn pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.86,0:14:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna chase you all the way to the\Nend of hell if that's what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you got a problem with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,then why don't you just kill\Nme and get it over with?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.22,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you put Nami and\NRobin in danger even though they have
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing to do with this because some\Nmoron drew a crappy picture of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they're part of the crew that made\Nyou a famous pirate in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm gonna take revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I might as well wipe out the rest\Nof your crew while I'm at it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you are making it out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Poison harpoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Convert to trap mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pervert?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.93,0:14:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to pull him\Ninto the ocean and drown him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, get out of there quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.46,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to a watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.36,0:15:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.56,0:15:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need both of you drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle this one. I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You humans are too slow underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never catch up in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, but you don't stand a\Nchance against the speed of my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, even you should know that flying\Nfish are the fastest creatures in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And my men have oxygen tanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so they can take their\Nsweet time making sure your
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,little friend is nice and\Ndead by the time he comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.07,0:15:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have crushed the life out\Nof that bastard with my own two hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least I know he'll die suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what happens when\Nyou piss off the head, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Katie, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you may have forgotten\Nabout a little somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.38,0:16:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you said, flying fish are\Ndefinitely faster than fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And when it comes to sea creatures,\Nthey're in the top class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.56,0:16:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But, just to let you know, there is one\Ncreature that's even faster than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,In every sea in this wide world,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing great or small\Nthat can out-swim a mermaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there real soon, okay? Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really that awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and if she wasn't spacing out all the time,\Nnothing would ever be able to catch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.12,0:16:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.36,0:16:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.27,0:16:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.48,0:17:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.26,0:17:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like an anchor,\Nbut crap, that's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aim for the center of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we drop this,\Nthey'll sink like a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.18,0:17:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them have Devil Fruit power,\Nso that'll take out half the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Nsurvive that. Dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the burst for the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.62,0:17:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.56,0:17:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, hurry! Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.18,0:17:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the bow and stay on standby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but whatever you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna bust out\Nour super secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.52,0:17:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What super secret weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.92,0:17:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna stick to Sonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonny won't die. Believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The main is spinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to happen? Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.74,0:18:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency evacuation secret\Nweapon, Chicken Voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.32,0:18:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, they dodged it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.72,0:18:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell do you make your ship\Ngo backwards in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp, get inside the prowl! Get inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it opens!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.98,0:18:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not just running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.88,0:18:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Sunny's got another trick that's\Nabout to knock your socks off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cola energy charging!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.92,0:18:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that? Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Charging complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.42,0:18:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get as many as you can\Nin the circle. A circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.08,0:18:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, they're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock on with the button below you,\Nthen pull the lever. Blow me, huh? Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.86,0:19:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, it's glowing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Down, cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're way too impressed with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.11,0:20:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've seen the Sonny's true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.50,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got almost all the\Nflying fish guys in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.52,0:20:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can thank Usopp for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad for a first try, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.23,0:20:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Scooby! Sonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.30,0:20:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good show, Mr. Lion!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.88,0:20:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes nearly popped out of my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.28,0:20:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or, hey, what up, if I had any.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chicken Voyage uses three\Nbarrels of cola up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.94,0:20:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But right after,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,it also fires a two-barrel\Ncoup to burst in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.04,0:20:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,back to stop the ship\Nfrom getting blown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.40,0:20:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, it uses a buttload of cola,\Nso it's not something we can do often.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She tanned us up in the net!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that mermaid's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.92,0:21:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Sanji-Chen, we're gonna make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.97,0:21:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.32,0:21:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Sanji okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.24,0:21:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's losing a bunch of\Nblood for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.33,0:21:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.36,0:21:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he was okay at first, but\Nblood started pouring out of his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, nosebleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.26,0:21:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.74,0:21:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If he wants to die like\Nthat, then let him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.24,0:21:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's what he would have wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.60,0:21:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Sanji Chen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I die and go to heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You little punk, if you weren't\Nfriends with a mermaid, you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you lost a\Nlot of men back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need the flying fish riders\Nas long as I've got Motobalo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I ride this guy\Nbecause he looks cool? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Countless have fallen prey to his horns He\Npoked holes in the village dam back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you try putting him in\Na cage, he smashes the bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The marines keep hounding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.40,0:22:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I escape them every time because this\Nguy's always ready to bust some heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't call his horns the\Nheart rippers for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.20,0:22:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Motobolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.12,0:22:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The horse can't even reach him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.96,0:22:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting, you big cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.32,0:22:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Motobolo, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Cal's acting weird. All of a sudden
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.94,0:22:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.56,0:22:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,happened
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.47,0:22:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,guess it passed
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,out did I just miss something hey\NLuffy what was that I didn't do
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything I think. Oh, what is my life?\NSucks so much. Whatever he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't seem like an attack it's more\NMore like he won the animal over,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.34,0:23:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,or at least knocked it over when\Nhe spoke to it face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.20,0:23:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.36,0:23:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying he psyched the thing out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Luffy's tough, but\Nthat ox doesn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.00,0:23:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's just a Secret cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, I'm gonna murder you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.96,0:23:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.52,0:23:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.43,0:23:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad you made it out okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.30,0:23:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back and let me\Ntake care of this whiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I just met him, and he's already\Nbeen a pain in my ass for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.06,0:23:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.26,0:23:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking, black\Nleg, until you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.26,0:23:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,An innocent guy like me can't find\Na moment of peace in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.34,0:23:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the criminal here, and I'm\Nsick of paying for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.12,0:23:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think I feel seeing\Nthat crappy picture come to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.62,0:23:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A stupid face like that\Nshouldn't exist in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.50,0:24:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.20,0:24:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.60,0:24:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Show it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Push it! Dance! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.40,0:24:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.68,0:24:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Arasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now eat this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.00,0:24:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a full course of my best\Ntechniques served up free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.10,0:24:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's the last you'll ever\Ntaste, you piece of crap.
